'''Peter Slutsker''' {{born|17|April|1958}} is a former actor who appeared as four different characters in episodes of {{s|TNG}} and {{s|VOY}}. In all three of his TNG appearances, he portrayed [[Ferengi]]. Slutsker changed his name legally around the millennium and is known today as '''Peter Marx'''.

For the episode "Year of Hell", he filmed his scenes on Wednesday {{d|13|August|1997}} on [[Paramount Stage 8]] and for "Year of Hell, Part II" on Wednesday {{d|27|August|1997}} on [[Paramount Stage 9]]. His costume from this episode was later sold off on the [[It's A Wrap! sale and auction]] on eBay. {{stala|4788}}

Slutsker was born in New York City, New York and grew up in Morristown, New Jersey. Between 1987 and 2002, he was married to dancer and actress Barbara Hoon. Following their divorce, Slutsker became a single father and retired from acting in 2004.

